+\`packs-tests/pack-directory.test.mjs\`; regenerate by running that test in a canon checkout.
+
+| Pack | What it covers | Not this pack | Activation | Requires |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+${rows.join('\n')}
+`;
+}
